---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro';
import CTABanner from '../components/CTABanner.astro';
import { PHASES } from '../lib/constants';

const [foundation, partnership] = PHASES;
---

<PageLayout
  title="Partnership — 1404 | How we work with you"
  description="How 1404 works with you: a one-time Foundation to get your people and systems ready, then an ongoing Partnership on a flat monthly retainer, with a share of the value we create together."
>
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pt-40 pb-24 md:pb-32">

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-20">
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-text-primary leading-tight">
        The partnership
      </h1>
      <p class="text-text-secondary text-lg mt-6 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        Forward-deployed engineers who embed in your business, stand up your AI foundation, then stay on as your technology partner.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Intro -->
    <div class="mb-24">
      <div class="space-y-6 text-text-body text-base leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          We are not a tool you log into. We are a team that builds inside your business and runs alongside you. It starts with a one-time Foundation, then continues as an ongoing Partnership on a flat monthly retainer.
        </p>
        <p>
          Most companies have tried AI by now, and the experience is the same. We build the strategy from your growth plan, put it to work, and keep refining it as you grow.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Foundation -->
    <div class="mb-24">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-copper mb-3 tracking-wide uppercase">{foundation.kicker}</p>
      <SectionHeading title="Foundation" subtitle={foundation.descriptor} />

      <ul class="space-y-6 mb-8">
        {foundation.bullets.map((b) => (
          <li class="border-l-2 border-copper-dim pl-8">
            <p class="text-text-body text-base leading-relaxed">
              <span class="text-text-primary font-medium">{b.lead}</span> {b.rest}
            </p>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>

      <p class="text-text-secondary text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        The Foundation is a one-time engagement, billed at signing, done on-site. It is priced off the scope of the setup, the number of users, and the size of your business.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Partnership -->
    <div class="mb-24">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-copper mb-3 tracking-wide uppercase">{partnership.kicker}</p>
      <SectionHeading title="Partnership" subtitle={partnership.descriptor} />

      <ul class="space-y-6 mb-8">
        {partnership.bullets.map((b) => (
          <li class="border-l-2 border-copper-dim pl-8">
            <p class="text-text-body text-base leading-relaxed">
              <span class="text-text-primary font-medium">{b.lead}</span> {b.rest}
            </p>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>

      <p class="text-text-secondary text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        One flat monthly retainer, unlimited scope, never re-scoped. It covers everything we build and the ongoing care of your Foundation, and we keep the whole system running so you don't have to think about it. You cover hard costs like third-party tools and infrastructure at pass-through.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Success sharing -->
    <div class="mb-24">
      <SectionHeading title="We share in the upside" />

      <div class="space-y-6 text-text-body text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mb-10">
        <p>
          Because the retainer stays flat and the scope stays open, we earn more only by building things that create more value for you. Each quarter we agree, conservatively and in conversation, on the value created or saved. Then we take a small share of what lands above the retainer you have already paid.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do better only when you do. The share keeps paying while what we built keeps making or saving you money, and it is tied to real dollars, never a paper valuation.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-l-2 border-copper pl-8">
        <p class="text-text-body text-lg leading-relaxed">
          A minority share, typically <span class="text-text-primary font-medium">5 to 10%</span>, of the value created above the retainer. Agreed each quarter, together.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Compounding advantage -->
    <div class="mb-24">
      <SectionHeading title="What the system becomes over time" />

      <div class="space-y-6 text-text-body text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        <p>
          Every month the system learns more about how your business runs. After a year, it understands patterns and relationships that no single person could track on their own.
        </p>
        <p>
          After two years, a competitor starting from scratch can't easily catch up to what you have built. Each year's work compounds on the last. Companies that start early set the pace in their market instead of chasing it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <a href="/case-studies/tcg" class="inline-block mt-6 text-sm text-copper hover:text-copper-bright transition-colors duration-200">
        See it in the TCG timeline &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Terms -->
    <div class="mb-24">
      <SectionHeading title="The terms" />

      <div class="space-y-6 text-text-body text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        <p>
          A one-year initial term, invoiced in advance, covering the Foundation and the ongoing build. It renews for another year automatically, and either of us can step away with 90 days' written notice. There is no lock-in beyond the term you are in.
        </p>
        <p>
          Everything we build is 1404's intellectual property, and you hold a license to use it for as long as we are working together.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Closing -->
    <div class="border-t border-border pt-16">
      <p class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl text-text-primary leading-snug max-w-3xl">
        On call anytime to think through ideas, problems, and anything that moves your business toward its goals. Your wins are our wins.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTABanner />
</PageLayout>
